    ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

    RUT_BlueDesert                                UtinniPatches · authored 2026-09-09
    Full sheet: design/Jawa/worldbuilding/biomes/the_blue_desert.md (FROZEN,
    BIOME_FREEZE_FABLE_REVIEW_1). Replaces the donor GRiNDTerra Biomes def
    BiomeGRimond ("Blue desert") on the 1,029 tiles it currently holds — own def,
